From webrtc-sdk/webrtc m150_release (the desktop part of 89d790b): the audio device module
tells an observer when devices come and go (Windows: IMMNotificationClient), which the
wrapper's RTCAudioDevice::OnDeviceChange uses; PulseAudio and ALSA start and stop
recording and playout more safely; the audio device buffer takes a new transport while
media runs. The Apple audio engine parts of the same commit are left out.

